      equipment: '36 cards: A, K, O (Queen), U (Jack), 10, 9, 8, 7, 6.\n**Cards vary by suit color**: German-Swiss (Acorns, Bells, Roses, Shields) or French (Hearts, Diamonds, Clubs, Spades).',
